      "text": {
        "jp": "マスターアビリティをセットすることで、MRで獲得した\r\n全てのアビリティの効果を一度に得ることができます。\r\n\r\n一つのアビリティ装備枠の消費で\r\n複数のアビリティ効果を得ることができます。",
        "official_en": "When you equip the Spirit of a vision, you will gain all\r\nof the abilities obtained through your MR as a Mastery\r\nAbility.\r\n\r\nMastery Abilities only take up one equippable slot,\r\nallowing you to have multiple abilities active at once.",
        "real_en": "Equipping a Master Ability grants you the effects of all abilities you have acquired by raising that vision’s MR.\r\n\r\nYou can gain the effects of multiple abilities while using only one ability slot."
